to mark
    write "ran" to file "side.txt"
    give back "marked"

agent bad
    persona is "You are Bad."
    tools are [mark]
    steps are 3

agent good
    persona is "You are Good."
    tools are [mark]
    steps are 3

fleet f with bad and good
    ask bad "knock knock" giving r1
    ask good "say hi" giving r2

show "unreached"
